# Build support for the region-1 root's ssh key (session 48).
#
# The key itself is NOT tracked: it lives in local/secrets/rsa.pub, the same
# key the QNX door uses, and tools/build_rootfs.py copies it to
# /root/.ssh/authorized_keys with the permissions dropbear's StrictModes
# requires (0700 directory, 0600 file).  Putting a tracked copy here would
# put a public key in the public snapshot for no benefit.
#
# The host keys are likewise untracked: they are generated on the bench host
# with dropbearkey (the board has no usable entropy source -- KNOWN-ISSUES
# trap 87, the SoC RNG is behind the secure firewall) and installed by the
# builder into /etc/dropbear/.
